WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.404 --> 00:00:03.248
建立文本示例连接 / Connect the text example client

2
00:00:03.248 --> 00:00:06.248
选中 WebSocket 连接 / Select the WebSocket connection

3
00:00:06.248 --> 00:00:09.096
打开 Messages / Open Messages

4
00:00:09.096 --> 00:00:11.998
打开连接断点设置 / Open connection breakpoint settings

5
00:00:11.998 --> 00:00:14.897
选择 Sent，仅暂停发送消息 / Choose Sent messages

6
00:00:14.897 --> 00:00:17.747
启用 Sent 文本断点 / Enable Sent message breakpoints

7
00:00:17.747 --> 00:00:20.847
发送 hello-original 并暂停 / Pause hello-original

8
00:00:20.847 --> 00:00:23.697
Continue unmodified 原样发送 / Continue the sent text unmodified

9
00:00:23.697 --> 00:00:26.659
发送 edit-this 并暂停 / Pause edit-this

10
00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:29.547
选择发送帧的 Text / Choose Text for the sent frame

11
00:00:29.547 --> 00:00:32.398
输入 edited-by-guide / Enter edited-by-guide

12
00:00:32.398 --> 00:00:35.299
Forward edited，核对源站和echo / Forward the edited text and verify its echo

13
00:00:35.299 --> 00:00:38.246
发送 do-not-forward 并暂停 / Pause do-not-forward

14
00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:41.109
Drop 发送帧 / Drop the sent frame

15
00:00:41.109 --> 00:00:43.946
停用 Sent 设置 / Disable the Sent configuration

16
00:00:43.946 --> 00:00:46.807
重新打开连接设置 / Reopen connection settings

17
00:00:46.807 --> 00:00:49.698
选择 Received / Choose Received messages

18
00:00:49.698 --> 00:00:52.548
启用 Received 文本断点 / Enable Received message breakpoints

19
00:00:52.548 --> 00:00:55.495
源站发送 server-original / Pause server-original from the origin

20
00:00:55.495 --> 00:00:58.347
Continue unmodified 原样接收 / Continue the received text unmodified

21
00:00:58.347 --> 00:01:01.400
源站发送 server-edit-this / Pause server-edit-this

22
00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.250
选择接收帧的 Text / Choose Text for the received frame

23
00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:07.098
输入 server-edited-by-guide / Enter server-edited-by-guide

24
00:01:07.098 --> 00:01:09.948
Forward edited，客户端收到替换文本 / Forward the replacement to the client

25
00:01:09.948 --> 00:01:12.897
源站发送 server-do-not-forward / Pause server-do-not-forward

26
00:01:12.897 --> 00:01:15.746
Drop 接收帧 / Drop the received frame

27
00:01:15.746 --> 00:01:18.596
关闭连接断点 / Disable connection breakpoints

28
00:01:18.596 --> 00:01:21.357
核对关闭后正常echo / Verify normal echo after disabling

29
00:01:21.357 --> 00:01:24.247
正常关闭示例连接 / Close the example connection normally
